{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日向坂46の丹生明里(にぶ あかり)です🐸🥕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はお花ブログですっ！💐"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒い羊inパシフィコ横浜の際にいただいたお花です☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HF0827C8KN1V3V44DCAT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n沢山ありがとう〜！こんなにたくさんのバラは初めて嬉しい😭幸せです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HG0FCDD734KA771AZM3N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nひまわりが詰まってる〜！黒い羊の握手会もあっという間でした！😃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HH6X583SVFR1D14G0FPW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nピンクのふわふわがキュート♡とっても癒されました☺️こちらこそ！！！  "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HJ65YYJHPAQ7R5F0WPDM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n緊張するけど頑張る！お花が浴衣にあってて素敵☺️ミニうちわも可愛いな😍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HK43RX98GH79WQNB39GE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nマーロン！😆黄色のお花が明るくて可愛いです！ドラゴンボール大好き！(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HM1YCPZ1GMDRC0YKHQCE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nピンク紫の組み合わせ大好きだよ〜！😍ありがとうね！がんばるね〜！😆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HN8SQJS40R60RQCEZQ2X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n青いバラと白いお花が素敵☺️しっかり受け入れたいです！がんばるありがと！(^^) "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HP65KPX8ZQZ5BP2DN1WK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n赤がたくさんだーっ！夏を感じました🌀ドレミソラシド、楽しみだね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HQ8ZX7XYQHJ1HRHKS835","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n黄色のバラ可愛い〜😆こちらこそみなさんからパワーをいただいてます☺️たのしみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいつもいつも素敵なお花をありがとうございます😆\n握手レーンに入った時、たくさんのお花が迎えてくれてハッピーが爆発しちゃいます😭😭😭\nわたしのためにありがとう！\nお花パワーでこれからも頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ載せきれなかったお花もありますので後日載せますね〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでいただきありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#225"}],"source":"archive"}